        add(WildRiftItem("frozen_heart_defense", "Corazón de Hielo", ItemCategory.DEFENSE, 2650, "+80 Armadura, +250 Max Maná, +20 Aceleración de Habilidad", "Reduce all nearby enemies Velocidad de Ataque Armadura +80 Armadura +250 Max Maná +20 Ability HasteWinter's Caress: Basic attacks and Daño Mágico caused by you or inflicted upon you and nearby allies, will apply stacks of Chill to the enemy champion for 3 seconds. Each stack of Chill slows enemy Velocidad de Ataque by 9%, up to a maximum of 4 stacks or 36% Velocidad de Ataque reduction. Each individual ability has a 3 seconds Enfriamiento on applying Chill stacks.", "https://wr-meta.com/uploads/posts/2025-07/1753389159_frozen-heart.webp"))
