        add(WildRiftItem("bulwark_of_the_mountain_support", "Baluarte de la Montaña", ItemCategory.SUPPORT, 0, "+175 Vida Máxima, +10 Aceleración de Habilidad", "Kill minions to earn bonus Oro HP +175 Vida Máxima +10 Ability HasteSoulcast: Every 60 seconds, gains 75 Oro, 25 Vida and 2 Daño de Ataque, or 4 Poder de Habilidad (Adaptive); up to 250 Vida and 20 Daño de Ataque or 40 Poder de Habilidad (Adaptive).Deal 2 more damage to Sight Wards revealed by Sweeping Lens, Control Ward, and Scryer’s Bloom. When out of combat, gain 10% Velocidad de Movimiento when you move toward your Perfect Partner. If you're more than 2,500 units apart, this bonus Aumenta to 30%.", "https://wr-meta.com/uploads/posts/2025-07/1753389518_bulwark-of-the-mountain.webp"))
